description:
globs:
alwaysApply: false
---
- React components must be created using anonymous functions
- Component file names must use PascalCase (e.g., UserProfile.tsx)
- Components must be default exported at the end of the file
- Use arrow function syntax for components
- Keep components small and focused
- Use composition over inheritance

Example:
```tsx
const UserProfile = () => {
  return (
    <div>
      {/* Component content */}
    </div>
  );
};

export default UserProfile;
```
